# Staging/production notes:
# - Set OMNI_ENVIRONMENT=staging or production.
# - Set OMNI_INITIALIZE_DATABASE=false and run `alembic upgrade head` as a release step.
# - Set OMNI_SESSION_SECRET to a long random value.
# - Set OMNI_ALLOWED_ORIGINS to the deployed frontend origin(s), never "*".
# - Set OMNI_OUTBOUND_LOCAL_ADAPTER_ENABLED=false in staging/production after live provider adapters are configured.
# - Set OMNI_REDIS_URL to managed Redis in staging/production.
# - Keep AI_Key out of git. Setup Production credentials can save the Anthropic key; OMNI_ANTHROPIC_* remains a runtime fallback.
# - Setup Email settings can save jimb@wakanow.com IMAP/SMTP values; OMNI_EMAIL_* remains a runtime fallback.
# - Setup Production credentials can save SMS, voice, WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, and alert webhook values; OMNI_* provider values remain runtime fallbacks.
# - OMNI_ATTACHMENT_STORAGE_BACKEND=s3 and complete OMNI_ATTACHMENT_S3_* settings are mandatory in staging/production.
# - OMNI_ATTACHMENT_SCANNER_ADAPTER=http and OMNI_ATTACHMENT_SCANNER_HTTP_* are mandatory in staging/production.
# - Production requires Microsoft Entra OIDC, wakanow.com-only identities, verified email, disabled auto-provisioning, and explicit group-to-role/market maps.
# - Set OMNI_PASSWORD_LOGIN_MODE=break_glass and name only audited admin identities in OMNI_BREAK_GLASS_ADMIN_EMAILS; each must have TOTP enabled.
